# MOVIE: राधा कृष्ण — प्रेम की अमर कथा
# CAST: RADHA (young woman in red lehenga, graceful, marigold in her hair), KRISHNA (young man with soft blue skin, peacock feather crown, yellow silk dhoti)

## SCENE 1: यमुना के किनारे
SETTING: Vrindavan at golden dusk, the Yamuna river flowing gently, kadamba trees, marigold flowers everywhere
ACTION: Radha walks along the riverbank gathering flowers, the evening wind gently lifts her veil

NARRATOR (warm): वृंदावन की इस मिट्टी में, प्रेम ही साँस लेता है।

## SCENE 2: बांसुरी का आह्वान
SETTING: Moonlit forest grove by the Yamuna, fireflies glowing, silver mist floating over the water
ACTION: Krishna plays the bansuri flute resting against a kadamba tree, notes drifting across the river

KRISHNA (tender, smiling): राधे, तेरे बिन वृंदावन भी वीरान है।
RADHA (blushing, playful): तो फिर बांसुरी किस लिए बजाते हो, कान्हा?

## SCENE 3: रासलीला
SETTING: Decorated courtyard of Vrindavan at night, hundreds of glowing diyas, flower garlands hanging
ACTION: Radha and Krishna dance together in the rasa circle, anklets chiming, garlands swirling in the air

NARRATOR (uplifted): जहाँ प्रेम होता है, वहीं ईश्वर नाचता है।

## SCENE 4: चाँद की विदाई
SETTING: Riverside under a huge full moon, silver light shimmering on the water, blooming lotuses
ACTION: Radha and Krishna look into each other's eyes, a single flower garland joins their hands

RADHA (soft, deep): तू है तो सब कुछ है, कान्हा।
KRISHNA (eternal, loving): प्रेम वो नहीं जो मिलता है... प्रेम वो है जो रह जाता है।
